        {
          "id": "d23-title",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Lumen Education — Q3 2025 Operations Report",
          "heading": 1,
          "style": "h1",
          "tocEntry": "Lumen Education — Q3 2025 Operations Report",
          "tocLevel": 1,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d23-s1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "1. Executive Summary",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "1. Executive Summary",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 29.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d23-s1-p0",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Lumen Education closed Q3 2025 with a disciplined cost programme and a pricing reset. As a company focused on vocational learning platforms, the leadership team tracked regional performance, headcount, pricing, service levels and vendor spend against the annual plan, all of which are detailed in the sections that follow.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 43.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d23-s1-owner",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The API Gateway platform is owned by the Developer Experience team; its on-call lead for the quarter is Leila Farahani, who also chairs the weekly reliability review.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 80.4
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d23-s1-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Detailed departmental commentary is available in the appendix distributed to budget owners.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 104.6
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d23-s2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "2. Regional Performance",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "2. Regional Performance",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 122.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d23-s2-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The table below breaks down performance by sales region. Growth is measured against the prior quarter in constant currency, and churn counts customers who did not renew during the period.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 136.9
          },
          "width": 166
        }
      ]
    },
