        {
          "id": "d23-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "For Q4 2025 the plan assumes a return to hiring in engineering and customer success. The board approved a capital expenditure budget of $7.4M for Q4 2025, weighted towards fleet renewal.",
